  "title": "CAPRI APARTMENTS",
  "tickerText": "WELCOME TO CAPRI APARTMENTS — YOUR RELAXED BASE IN BEAUTIFUL MERIMBULA. SETTLE IN, UNPACK AND ENJOY THE SPACE, THE GARDENS AND THOSE GREAT VIEWS ACROSS MERIMBULA BAY AND THE PACIFIC. YOUR APARTMENT IS FULLY SELF-CONTAINED, WITH A WELL-EQUIPPED KITCHEN, PRIVATE LAUNDRY, FREE WIFI, HEATING AND COOLING, COMFORTABLE BEDS AND ALL LINEN PROVIDED. WHEN YOU’RE READY TO UNWIND, TAKE A DIP IN THE SOLAR-HEATED POOL, RELAX IN THE SPA OR ENJOY A BBQ WHILE THE KIDS EXPLORE THE PLAY AREA. SOME OF THE SOUTH COAST’S BEST BEACHES ARE ONLY MINUTES AWAY, ALONG WITH MERIMBULA’S SHOPS, CAFES, SEAFOOD, WATER SPORTS AND LOCAL ATTRACTIONS. WHETHER YOU’RE HERE TO SWIM, FISH, EXPLORE OR SIMPLY SLOW DOWN, WE HOPE YOU FEEL AT HOME FROM THE MOMENT YOU ARRIVE. ENJOY YOUR STAY.",
